 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음 식을 간단히 하시오.\n⑴ $\\frac{1}{4}ab^{4}\\times 12a^{5}$ ⑵ $-7x^{5}y^{2}\\times(-4x^{4}y^{6})$\n⑶ $7ab^{4}\\times(-4a^{3}b)^{2}$ ⑷ $(-xy^{4})^{3}\\times(4x^{3}y)^{2}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $3a^{6}b^{4}$ ⑵ $28x^{9}y^{8}$ ⑶ $112a^{7}b^{6}$ ⑷ $-16x^{9}y^{14}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $\\frac{1}{4}\\times 12=3$, $a\\times a^{5}=a^{6}$이므로 $3a^{6}b^{4}$이다.\n⑵ $(-7)\\times(-4)=28$, $x^{5}\\times x^{4}=x^{9}$, $y^{2}\\times y^{6}=y^{8}$이므로 $28x^{9}y^{8}$이다.\n⑶ $(-4a^{3}b)^{2}=16a^{6}b^{2}$이므로 $7ab^{4}\\times 16a^{6}b^{2}=112a^{7}b^{6}$이다.\n⑷ $(-xy^{4})^{3}=-x^{3}y^{12}$, $(4x^{3}y)^{2}=16x^{6}y^{2}$이므로 $-x^{3}y^{12}\\times 16x^{6}y^{2}=-16x^{9}y^{14}$이다.",
 "score": null,
